;
; How Vintner files a lot in MYRA (vintner_model.h VN4): its lot number,
; its vintage (the harvest year), its stage (1 harvest, 2 must, 3 barrel,
; 4 bottled), the bottles filled and the volume it holds now, in ml.
^ZXVINTNER(lot:i9) = vintage:i4! ^ stage:i1! ^ bottles:i9! ^ volume:i12!
